// ============================================================================
// Things to look at in the canopy (Chapter 4): one knot per interactable in
// src/data/areas/canopy/*.ts. DRAFT text for the designer to rewrite: short,
// in the carver's eye, and the carver is scared and shocked by everything
// up here (designer).
// ============================================================================

// --- The tube mouth ---

=== c4_look_basin ===
A basin padded with old cloth, under the open end of the tube.
This morning's offerings lie in it where they fell. A comb from the roots. A cup. A bowl you'd know anywhere.
Nobody's kneeling to them.
-> END

=== c4_look_tentacles ===
The tube doesn't stop at the Canopy. It comes out of the top of the tree and splits into eight, curling over like arms.
The same light as the one you prayed to every morning, running up inside them.
-> END

=== c4_look_crates ===
Crates, nailed shut, with marks painted on them you can't read.
-> END

=== c4_look_birds ===
Carved birds along the rail. Dozens of them, in bare wood, every one different.
Somebody sent each one up. Somebody prayed over every one.
-> END

=== c4_look_canopy ===
Leaves, and houses in the leaves, further than you can see.
And over it all, nothing at all. Just sky.
-> END

// --- The great house ---

=== c4_look_sorting ===
Long tables, and on them everything the tree sent up this morning.
Two piles. One into baskets. One into crates, nailed shut.
-> END

=== c4_look_chute ===
A chute down through the floor. The crates go into it, and you hear them go a long way down.
-> END

=== c4_look_workbench ===
Benches, tools, shavings. Things half made.
You know these shapes. You've seen them come down the tube every evening of your life.
-> END

=== c4_look_blessings ===
Shelves of blessings, finished, waiting to go down. Jars of light. Bundles. Carvings.
Made here. By hand.
-> END

=== c4_look_kitchen ===
A stove, a pot on it, herbs hanging to dry. It smells like somebody's home.
-> END

=== c4_look_mess ===
Long tables, bowls. Not much in each.
-> END

// --- The message loft ---

=== c4_look_plates ===
Plates on the wall. An eye. A wing. A seed. A cage.
Every one you ever rubbed clean by your fire, hanging here where somebody made them.
-> END

=== c4_look_loft_bench ===
A carver's bench under the skylight. A blank plate on it, and a scratching tool.
-> END

=== c4_look_loft_pipe ===
A pipe with a funnel at the top, running down through the floor.
To the tube.
-> END

// --- The walkways ---

=== c4_look_houses ===
Houses, everywhere, built into the branches. Doors, windows, washing. Smoke from a pipe.
People live up here. All of them.
-> END

=== c4_look_beehives ===
Hives. A hum you can feel in your teeth, warm and busy.
-> END

=== c4_look_washing ===
Washing on a line, flapping. Somebody's shirts.
You don't know why that's the thing that makes your throat go tight.
-> END

=== c4_look_drop ===
You look down. Leaves, and leaves under them, and somewhere under all of it, the ground.
You hold the rope tighter.
-> END

=== c4_look_tank ===
A tank of rainwater, piped off to the houses. It all goes somewhere. Nothing's wasted.
-> END

// --- The ascended's hall ---

=== c4_look_last_pieces ===
Niches along the wall, and in every one a master's last piece. The ones they carried up, the night the Tree chose them.
Every one with the spiral cut into it. You watched some of these go.
-> END

=== c4_look_alcoves ===
Curtained rooms off the hall. A bed, a cup, a pair of slippers.
People live here. People you were told had gone to the Canopy for ever.
-> END

=== c4_look_columns ===
A limb of the tree, growing straight up through the floor and out through the roof.
-> END

// --- Grounded's house ---

=== c4_look_your_birds ===
Birds. Rows and rows of them, red, every one with the same heavy wing.
Yours. Every one you ever sent up.
-> END

=== c4_look_groundeds_bench ===
A carver's bench. Good tools, worn smooth. Something half done, and done well.
-> END

=== c4_look_radio ===
A box with dials and a light that blinks. It hisses quietly to itself.
-> END

=== c4_look_chart ===
A drawing of the treetop: the tubes, the houses, little marks you can't read.
-> END

// --- The seed bed ---

=== c4_look_seedlings ===
Seedlings in rows, each one glowing faintly at its tip, amber, like the seeds in the grove.
-> END

=== c4_look_your_seed ===
{ seed:
- "healthy": The seed you sent up. It's sprouted under its glass: green, and glowing amber at the tip.
- "roots": The seed you sent up. It's sprouted under its glass, but wrong: pale, and green at the tip, like the rot.
- else: An empty bed under a glass bell.
}
-> END

=== c4_look_instruments ===
Glass, brass, little scales. Things for measuring that you've no names for.
-> END

// --- The lookout ---

=== c4_look_spyglass ===
A spyglass on a stand. You put your eye to it.
Far off, past the edge of everything, a cluster of lights on the horizon.
-> END

=== c4_look_treetop ===
Leaves. Leaves to the edge of the world. And you're standing on top of them.
-> END

// --- The lowering platform ---

=== c4_look_winch ===
A great drum, wound with cable, and a wheel to turn it. The cable runs out over the edge and down.
-> END

=== c4_look_going_down ===
Crates, nailed shut, marked. Waiting to go down.
Everything you made. Everything anyone made.
-> END

=== c4_look_tally ===
A board, notched in rows. Somebody's counting.
-> END

// --- The hatches ---

=== c4_look_hatch_glow ===
Light, seeping through the wood. Blue. You know that light.
The tube's just the other side of this.
-> END

// --- The outside deck ---

=== c4_look_radio_hut ===
A hut of metal panels, riveted, nothing like anything in the tree. A light glows in its window.
-> END

=== c4_look_outside_view ===
The ground, down there in the dark. And you're outside the tree.
Nobody in the tree knows this is here.
-> END

// --- The quartermaster's family ---

=== c4_look_store_shed ===
A shed, the door ajar. Inside, crates stacked up. Crates like the ones on the lowering platform.
-> END

=== c4_look_homestead_garden ===
Rows of something green, pushing up out of the dirt.
-> END

=== c4_look_groundeds_books ===
Books. More than you've seen in your life, more than the archive. Crammed in, piled up, read to pieces.
-> END

=== c4_look_groundeds_wing ===
A wing, painted big on the wall. The wing from the plates he sent you.
-> END

=== c4_look_groundeds_desk ===
Papers everywhere. Lines crossed out, written again, crossed out. A candle burnt right down.
Somebody's been up all night with this, more than once.
-> END

=== c4_look_press ===
A heavy frame with a screw in it, and stacks of paper tied up beside it. The wing on the top sheet.
-> END

=== c4_look_world_map ===
A map, but not of the tree. The tree's a little mark in one corner. Threads run from it to places you've never heard of.
-> END
